line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.230   Water skiing.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.240   Beaver Lake restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.250   Lake Margaret restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.280   Steel Lake restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.290   Star Lake restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.300   Lake Leota restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.310   North Lake restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.320   Pipe Lake&#8209;Lake Lucerne restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.330   Spring Lake restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.340   Cottage Lake restrictions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.44.350   Whistles and lights.</span></p>

