text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            B.  Abatement by closure of such business or
commercial enterprise for from five to thirty days for each subsequent
conviction under Section 12.63.090 within twenty&#8209;four months of any
previous conviction.  (Ord. 7186 § 4, 1985).</span></p>

