-.1pt'>            12.66.010   Solicitation prohibited if sign posted.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.66.020   Exemptions.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.66.030   Enforcement by sheriff.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>            12.66.040   Penalties.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;text-align:
justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            <b>12.66.010 
Solicitation prohibited if sign posted.</b>  If a person has not been requested
or invited by the occupant, the person shall not enter or remain upon any
private premises for the purpose of contacting the occupant to solicit the
immediate or future purchase or sale of goods, services or any other thing of
value if a sign stating &quot;No Solicitation&quot; or &quot;No
Trespassing&quot; is posted at or near the entrance to the premises.  (Ord.
17204 <span style='letter-spacing:-.1pt'>§</span> 2, 2011).</span></p>

<p class=Normal style='text-align:justify'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;text-align:justify;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            <b>12.66.020 
Exemptions.</b>  The following are exempted from the prohibitions in K.C.C.
12.66.010:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            A. 
The leaving at private premises printed materials advertising products or
services;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            B. 
Solicitations by organizations that are charitable, nonprofit, religious or
political in nature, or by government agencies; and</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            C. 
Solicitations by farmers exempted under chapter 36.71.090 RCW.  (Ord. 17204 §
3, 2011).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:8.0pt;text-align:
justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            <b>12.66.030 
Enforcement by sheriff.</b>  The sheriff shall enforce this chapter, through
means including but not limited to K.C.C. Title 23.  (Ord. 17204 <span
style='letter-spacing:-.1pt'>§</span> 4, 2011).</span></p>

<p class=Normal style='text-align:justify'>&nbsp;</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;text-align:justify;
line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            <b>12.66.040 
Penalties.</b>  A violation of this chapter is a class 2 civil infraction
punishable under chapter 7.80 RCW.  (Ord. 17204 <span style='letter-spacing:
-.1pt'>§</span> 5, 2011).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
