<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            All the following area: the northeast quarter
of Section 13, Twp. 26 N., Range 5 E., W.M.; the north half of Section 18, Twp.
26 N., Range 6 E., W.M.; that portion of the northwest quarter of Section 17,
