southeast quarter of Section 7, Twp. 26 N., Range 6 E., W.M., a portion of
which lies within the area where shooting of firearms is prohibited by Section
12.68.130.  (Ord. 2604 § 1, 1976).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            <b>12.68.680  Cumberland precinct</b>.  The
shooting of firearms is prohibited in and around a portion of Cumberland
precinct described as:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-top:0in;
text-align:justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            Bound on the west by the west margin of the
Bonneville Transmission Line Easement; bound on the south by the south margin
