letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            <b>12.82.040  Clerk to send notice and file
maps.</b>  The clerk of the council shall send notice of adoption of each
ordinance approving a map pursuant to K.C.C. 12.82.020 or K.C.C. 12.82.030 of
this chapter to the clerks of the district and superior courts, the office of
the prosecuting attorney, the department of local services, the department of
public safety, the department of natural resources and parks, the police
department of each jurisdiction within which each mapped school or park is
located and the records and licensing services division as the custodian of
official county records.  (Ord. 18791 § 68, 2018:  Ord. 15971 § 69, 2007:  Ord.
14199 § 172, 2001:  Ord. 10508 § 2, 1992:  Ord. 10154 § 4, 1991).</span></p>

